Commentary: "Tough struggle is the hallmark of young Chinese Communist Party members"
(Beijing): July 1, 2021 will be the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China. 100 years of party formation, 72 years in power and more than 91 million members of the Chinese Communist Party. Some of these figures show the great and fascinating journey of the largest and most vibrant political party in the world.
Why is the Chinese Communist Party still full of youth and full of zeal? The whole world wants to find the password for the success of the Chinese Communist Party. According to statistics, by the end of 2019, Chinese Communist Party members under the age of 40 accounted for more than a third of the total.
As a political party that has been formed for a hundred years, it has been able to maintain such vigor and vibrancy that no other party in the world can compare. The reason is that within the ranks of the Chinese Communist Party, there are always young people who are idealistic, hard-working, and full of perseverance.
Speaking of his interest in fighting the spread of communicable diseases, Zhang Buali said he was deeply interested in the work of young Chinese Communist Party members among medical staff. The medical staff are just over 40, 30 or 20 years old, and the younger generation of medical staff make up 70% of the total medical staff.
In the fight against the spread of infectious diseases, these nephews are not afraid to sacrifice their lives and are brave and win this test. Zhang Buali noted that the medical staff, aged 40, 30 and 20, were "key players", "leading forces" and "vital forces" in the fight against infectious diseases.
Zhou Bin adheres to his standards until the end, turning workers into winners of global professional competitions, and making China a breakthrough in the construction of professional competitions. Biodiversity worldwide.
The younger generation is full of energy, vitality, duty and responsibility. At a critical time facing the death and life of the young Communist Party members, they did not hesitate and fulfilled their promises to the country and the people through their practical operations.
