(Pursat Province): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, through Oknha Try Pheap and Lok Chumteav Oknha Kien Srey Neang, donated food to five pagodas in Kravanh district and Veal Veng District, Pursat Province.
