The working group stated that these gifts came from the generosity of the tycoon and Lok Chumteav Oknha and to join with Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to solve the shortage of monks in the temple when the country is in trouble due to Epidemic of Kovid 19 disease.
On the occasion of bringing alms to the monks at the temple, the team also reminded Samdech Techo's recommendation given at the temple to blow drums as a message to remind people to participate in the fight against Kovid 19, as well as prayers. In order for Cambodia to be free from the plague of Kovid 19 virus.
The team also requested the monks to help disseminate to the people to participate in the implementation of health rules strictly. In particular, Samdech Techo's recommendation "3 protect and 3 do not"
Please also note that the team will continue to bring these gifts to the monks who are experiencing difficulties in other pagodas.
