* First, to push the economy back on the path of growth by promoting increased economic activity, especially new businesses and small and medium enterprises, which are considered as potential sources of job creation for the people and Can absorb a lot of labor. At the same time, we must continue to reform our structure to enhance Cambodia's competitiveness and economic diversification.
* Second, continue to support the implementation of social protection programs to be stronger and more resilient to crises to protect the poor, vulnerable, unemployed can live in times of crisis and liberation. Out of poverty after the crisis
* Third: Promote human resource development through technical education and other vocational training skills.
* Fourth: Strengthen the governance of public institutions to be stronger, smarter and cleaner.
* Fifth: Improving the quality of investment and environmentally resilient public infrastructure to support sustainable economic growth with the participation of the government, the private sector and development partners.
