Became the head of the UN only Secretary-General because he wanted to show the equality of all member countries. According to the UN website, for the sake of equality, the Secretary-General is a symbol of the ideals of the United Nations and a spokesperson for all the interests of the people. All over the world, especially the poor and vulnerable among them.
The UN Charter describes the Secretary-General as the "Head of Administration" of the organization as a whole, to perform and perform other functions assigned by the Security Council, the General Assembly, the Economic and Social Council, and the structure of the United Nations. Other nations. The Constitution also empowers the Secretary-General to urge the Security Council to address any issues that could threaten international peace and security.
