(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Public Works on March 23, 2021 confirmed that the payment of salaries to civil servants and contracted officials for April is carried out only once, plus the New Year allowance. This is according to the announcement of the Ministry of Public Works, which was received by Fresh News.
In this announcement, the Ministry of Public Works stated that the payment of salaries for April and May 2021 to civil servants and contracted officials must be implemented as follows:
First, the salary payment for April is to provide a one-time monthly salary, including allowances during the traditional New Year, and to reach each applicant no later than April 10, 2021. .
Second: Salary payment for May and subsequent months shall be provided every two weeks in accordance with the spirit of Circular No. 07S dated 12 December 2018 on determining the procedure for payment of salary every two weeks. Once a month to civil servants and other public officials.
