(Preah Sihanouk): On the afternoon of March 21, 2021, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, chaired an emergency meeting on the security case of Sihanoukville Business Center. Stakeholder participation also took place on the morning of March 20, 2021.
According to the video clip, both parties (security and the trader) explained that the reason for the problem arose from the dispute and the intention to destroy the trader's goods, not the damage.
He ordered that the security guard be taken for a thorough interrogation, despite the compensation for the damaged eggs, but that the person should be held accountable for his actions and should be dealt with as a matter of course. It is true that this case happened between two people, but it affected the control of the public authority, so it is necessary to consider and handle this case very carefully so that such immoral acts do not happen. .
The provincial governor agreed with the agreement of the parties, so it was not the Pope, as the brothers immediately changed their behavior, acknowledged the mistake and paid the damages, but he decided to impose an administrative fine on the advice of the center's director. Sihanoukville Business must not continue to use this person, but must terminate his job as a tax collector or security agent from now on.
At the same time, in order to compensate the affected traders, the provincial governor has ordered the manager of the Sihanoukville Business Center to waive the tax on his business for a whole year.
