* Fourth: During the three-day holiday on the occasion of the upcoming Khmer New Year, the Royal Government calls on all citizens to take the following measures:
Avoid unnecessary travel to or from areas or places at high risk of transmission of Kovid-19 as determined by the Ministry of Health and relevant authorities.
* Avoid organizing various ceremonies, including religious ceremonies or gatherings that are noisy and crowded.
