Commentary: Chinese people do not accept contemptuous behavior
In 1901, the Qing Dynasty government was forced to sign the "Xinzhou Treaty" with 11 countries, including Britain, the United States and Japan. The "Xinhua Treaty" is the most widely demanded treaty and the worst loss of sovereignty in modern Chinese history.
After signing the "Treaty of Hsinchu", the imperialist countries further increased their control and aggression against China. Thus, China became a semi-colonial, semi-feudal society.
In 1949, the People's Republic of China was founded, the Communist Party of China led the Chinese people to self-cultivation and hard work, transformed the poor face into a prosperous country, now China has become a major economic entity. Second in the world.
Compared to these two photos, many netizens are very interested. The world is still in a situation where big countries are abusing small countries, but China is no longer a country to be abused by others.
In this high-level strategic dialogue between China and the United States, the United States' actions and attitudes are not in line with the major countries with complete dignity. Speaking at the opening of the dialogue, the United States extended its speech and even accused and attacked China's national and international policies.
This is inconsistent with the reception system and diplomatic protocol, and also underscores America's perpetual hegemony. Faced with the unreasonable accusations and the hegemonic attitude of the United States, the Chinese side responded with reasonableness, showing a strong commitment and will to uphold the sovereignty, security and development interests of the nation.
Yang Jiechi, a member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and chairman of the Bureau of Diplomatic Affairs of the CPC Central Committee, responded that Taiwan, Hong Kong and Xinjiang are all inseparable parts of China. China strongly opposes US actions interfering in China's internal affairs.
The United States does not have the right to talk to China like its student teachers, saying, "The Chinese people will not accept it!" But focus on the dialogue between China and the United States this time as well.
