First: Participate in coordinating, managing, directing, organizing and planning the Kovid-19 vaccination plan within the framework of the Ministry of Tourism, which includes civil servants under the supervision and staff working in the tourism sector in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Second: Prepare a list of civil servants within the Ministry of Tourism who volunteered to vaccinate Kovid-19
Third: Coordinate with the private sector to prepare a list of tourism workers who volunteer to be vaccinated against Kovid-19.
Fourth, cooperate and coordinate with the Commission on the work of the Royal Government in vaccinating Kovid-19
Fifth: Monitoring and preparing the progress report to the Minister of Tourism and the Commission on a regular basis.
