(Phnom Penh): After receiving permission from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, the Ministry of Posts and Telecommunications has signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) with Microsoft Asia (Microsoft) to cooperate in resource development. People will promote the use of digital technology in Cambodia.
The MoU also aims to promote digital transformation through cooperation on human resource development, research and development, innovation and entrepreneurship in the field of information and communication technology, as well as policy and planning cooperation. Develop digital government.
