2: The association asks the relevant ministries and institutions to carefully inspect the importers in accordance with the proper permits to avoid importing fish in excess of the amount in the permit, which is the reason for the excess demand in the supply. Districts that strike an imbalance between domestic supply and imports of fish with lower competitive prices than domestic production.
