Li Qiang said that China-Cambodia friendship has a long history. The ties between the two peoples are deep, and in recent years, changes in various fields have continued to deepen, highlighting the "steel" inseparable ties between China and Cambodia.
"Shanghai is the birthplace of the Communist Party of China, China's largest economic center and a frontier of reform, and has been implementing the key guidelines of the Shanghai Municipal Party Committee," he said. President Xi Jinping arrives in Shanghai to accelerate the construction of the "Five Centers" and a modern, modern socialist international city that will bring this unique feature to the world.
Li Qiang hopes that through this high-level visit, he will deepen his understanding of Shanghai and push the friendly exchanges between the two sides to a new level. He also said that Shanghai will continue to strengthen cooperation and exchanges in various fields and make greater contributions to the development of Sino-Cambodian relations.
The King said he would join President Xi Jinping in inheriting this precious legacy and deepening the deep ties between the two countries' older leaders and marking a new chapter in Cambodia-Cambodia friendly cooperation. China.
