(Siem Reap): On the morning of March 16, 2021, General Khim Bunsong, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense, accompanied by Lt. Gen. Soeun Roeut, Advisor to Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh and Deputy Director of the Engineering Department of the Ministry of National Defense, together with road and bridge technical officers. Siem Reap City Hall officials inspected the road construction techniques of the 178th Engineering Corps, which is building roads in Siem Reap City.
During the inspection, the working group emphasized on the preparation of the road foundation, the installation of the drainage system, rainwater and sewage, as well as the preparation of the pavement, the standard techniques that the Ministry has introduced in the past to avoid Once completed, it must be excavated and repaired, leading to a loss of budget and time.
