On behalf of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, General Khim Bunsong praised the progress of the construction of 38 road infrastructure in the tourist city of Siem Reap, which is moving towards the development of a modern-smart city. The future, which is the long-term vision of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
He appreciated the smooth operation of all construction sites in its operation with high responsibility, following the technical specifications of the load book, which can be expected to be strong, durable and complete. Planned plan.
During the inspection of the road infrastructure construction site of the 178th Engineering Division of the Ministry of National Defense, General Khim Bunsong also praised all the engineering forces who have worked hard to build the road according to the construction technical standards. Also installed drainage system, rainwater and sewage with good technology to ensure long-term use.
In addition, some technical instructions were made to the technical team on the preparation of the sidewalks and the paving of the tiles according to the instructions of the technical team, how to prepare the road for the disabled to travel easily for them to avoid. The risks that occur to the people.
