Ministry of Tourism re-announces the exemption of tourism license renewal fee in 2021
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism has re-announced the exemption of all types of tourism license renewal fees in the tourism sector for 2021 to the owners of tourism service businesses across the country to help maintain business balance and the lives of workers in the tourism sector.
The decision to waive the tourism license renewal fee in 2021 is in accordance with the guidelines of the Government of Cambodia, which has decided to waive the renewal fee for all types of tourism licenses in the tourism sector for 2021.
At the same time, the Ministry of Tourism also called on all tourism service businesses to register through the QR Code to get exemption from the renewal fee for tourism license in 2021 and access to other information.
The Ministry of Tourism has already issued a notification on the implementation of additional measures of the Royal Government to exempt all types of tourism license renewal fees for 2021 on June 08, 2020.
The decision to waive the tourism license renewal fee for 2021 is made for the following purposes:
1: Exemption of renewal fees for all types of tourism licenses for 2021 for valid tourism licenses. All types of tourism businesses are still required to apply for renewal of tourism licenses from the Ministry of Tourism or the Capital-Provincial Administration or the Municipal-District-Khan Administration (depending on the size of the tourism business that the Ministry of Tourism has previously delegated) during the exemption period. .
2. Maintain all types of tourism license fees for tourism businesses that apply for a new or renewed tourism license in 2020 and apply for a new tourism license for 2021.
3. Maintain payment of public service fees for all types of tourism service classification applications.
4: Maintain the implementation of monetary penalties for tourism businesses that have expired, tourism licenses and businesses that have committed other offenses stipulated in Annex 3 of Inter-Ministerial Prakas No. 160 dated 17 February 2020 on the Provision of Public services and fines by the Ministry of Tourism, but the payment of public service fees for the renewal of tourism licenses for 2021 is still exempt.
5: Exemption from renewal fees for all types of tourism licenses will be implemented from January 1, 2021 to December 31, 2021.
