Through the two sessions of the National People's Congress, we can see that the Chinese central government is aware of the needs of 1.4 billion people everywhere. Through the General Assembly of both houses of parliament, we can see that the political system formed from the land of Chinese society is full of vitality and vitality. As in previous years, this "spring solemn assembly" has received a great deal of attention.
The global media focuses on the General Assembly of China's two parliaments. According to Western media reports, "China can actually hold a General Assembly of both houses of parliament as a victory" and it can be said without hesitation that the General Assembly of both houses of the Chinese National Assembly has attracted the attention of the whole world. They all want to see the future in this case.
History has shown that "Chinese democracy" is effective. In the new context, continue to promote the effectiveness of the regime, we will be able to concentrate better to write a more hopeful China story.
