It should be noted that the police force of the Bureau of Minor Offenses of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police on March 10, 2021 sent the accused husband and wife to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to decide according to the law related to the case of money laundering.
Authorities arrested the two defendants on an arrest warrant issued by Phnom Penh Municipal Court Investigating Judge Ouk Sovannrith.
The two defendants were investigated and charged by Mr. Seng Kimlak, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, on November 9, 2020, in accordance with Article 377 and Article 378 of the Penal Code
The indictment and the arrest of the two defendants were sent to this court based on the complaint dated March 12, 2020 by the victim, Jiang Long, a construction contractor.
During the incident, the two defendants and their accomplices tried to contact the victim to defraud tens of thousands of dollars by promising to run a large construction site at an international gate that the government planned to open near the gate. Poipet International Gate, Banteay Meanchey province, allows victims to receive contracts because they know close officials.
After defrauding the victims of all the money, the accused escaped until there was no work for the victims and refused to return the money to the victims, so the victims decided to file a lawsuit to seek justice. .
