During the operation on March 8-9, 2021, the provincial authorities found the person involved with 32 positive Kovid 19 men staying at the brick kiln business in Kang Meas district.
According to the Kampong Cham Provincial Administration Officer, Mr. Un Chanda led the local authority to inspect the location where the Cambodian man with the positive case of Kovid-19 came to stay in O'Kandol village, Prek Krabao commune, Kang Meas district.
As a result, the provincial authorities found 32 people involved in the brick kiln business in O Kandal village, Prek Kambao commune, Kang Meas district, and temporarily closed the brick kiln business, the official said.
