Samdech Techo Hun Sen's request was made through a special and urgent voice message related to the situation of Kovid 19 epidemic on the night of March 8, 2021.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized in the message that in the context of the spread of Kovid 19, the law on "Measures to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 and other deadly and serious infectious diseases" is very important. Manage.
Samdech Techo stated, "This law is urgently needed. "We can not use emergency law for this situation, but we need governing laws related to Kovid 19 and other deadly diseases."
Samdech Techo also called on the Acting President of the Senate to find the possibility and mechanism to review and approve the draft law.
This draft law has 6 chapters and 17 articles. The Council of Ministers approved the draft law on February 28 and the National Assembly passed it on March 5.
