Unbeknownst to him, he was infected with the Kovid-19 virus during his travels to and from his hometown. While taking a taxi from Sihanoukville to Phnom Penh, he visited his nephew at the hospital.
Then, on March 4, 2021, this man continued his journey from Stung Meanchey in front of Wat Kien Khleang, Chroy Changva and continued by taxi to Kampong Cham province, stopping at the traffic light at Prey Toteung market, Chrey Vien commune, Prey Chhor district and continued on The motodup continues to the house in O'Kandao village, Prek Krabao commune, Kang Meas district, Kampong Cham province.
On the morning of March 5, 2021, this man and his brother rode a motorbike to Prey Toteung Market and went shopping for fish and food for about 30 minutes before returning home.
The man interacted with many people, including when visiting his nephew at the hospital, met with two women escorting patients. One of them lives in Thlok Kravan village, Bos Khnor commune, Chamkar Leu district and the other one lives in O'Kandao village, Prek Krabao commune, Kang Meas district, Kampong Cham province (working at Dim Han Garment Factory in Stung Meanchey) but since he met this man, he has not returned to work because Ask for a busy law to accompany your sick nephew.
