The man expressed deep regret for his actions, disobeying the instructions of the authorities and the Ministry of Health, insulting and underestimating the situation and leading to hardship for the family and many people.
In a video from the hospital, the man expressed his sadness: "I tell my parents that if it is not necessary or not to go, please keep in place, do not go out. Like me, I'm sorry I did not listen, I was positive Kovid 19, so I went home, I made it difficult for my family. It's okay for me to have a hard time, but I make it difficult for a family. ”
