* Second, as a protection management phase, to ensure the retention of those involved in the Chattabsak area, this phase has been actively implemented by local forces for a long time, and the trained forces Now will be ready to contribute when the situation arises.
* Third: It is a stage of providing treatment to people with Kovid-19 disease. This stage is the responsibility of the doctors of the health departments of all provinces and the Ministry of Health has worked hard to continue to treat those who have a positive case, and as a result, so far the patients have recovered a lot and not yet. There have been no deaths from any Kovid-19 disease in Cambodia.
