(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chin Malin, Secretary of State and Spokesman of the Ministry of Justice, on March 5, 2021, clarified three points on the legal aspects and court proceedings in the case of the November 9 plan of Sam Rainsy, the illegal rebel leader and Parties.
The following is Mr. Jin Malin's explanation:
Mr. Chin Malin said that the above acts and activities have clear and strong evidence, and some of this evidence is easily available because Sam Rainsy and his accomplices have used Facebook and other social media as a way to post provocative messages. And serve for its above wicked action plans.
From a legal point of view, which country in the world does not consider "the plot to overthrow the coup" as illegal? Some countries even consider these groups to be terrorist organizations.
Therefore, it is only right that the Royal Government has put in place the necessary measures as an independent and sovereign state, including legal, political and diplomatic measures, to completely destroy the plan to destroy Cambodia led by prisoner Sam Rainsy. And factions and ensure the maintenance of peace, stability and well-being of the people.
* It is only right that countries around the world do not support the illegal plans of Sam Rainsy prisoners and their cronies and have contributed significantly to the failure of the plan to destroy the peace, security and stability of Cambodia led by prisoners Sam Rainsy and his cronies. Shame.
* It is only right that the laws of the Kingdom of Cambodia be strictly enforced to punish criminals on behalf of a sovereign state that adheres to the rule of law. According to the Penal Code of the Kingdom of Cambodia, the plot to overthrow the legitimate Royal Government shall be punished under "Murder Offenses" under Article 451, while those involved in the plot shall be punished for "conspiracy" under Article 451. 453.
The spokesman added that the arrest warrant issued by a Cambodian court is valid in the territory of the Kingdom of Cambodia, and in the event that the perpetrator escapes abroad, the prosecutor may request to be published as International arrest warrants through the Ministry of Justice, using effective mechanisms including: Interpol police mechanism, extradition mechanism with countries with extradition treaties with Cambodia, and so on.
Mr. Jean Malin further stated that, however, as a matter of law, the perpetrators of foreign nationals who own them will not be extradited to Cambodia. Similarly, Cambodia can not extradite its citizens to foreign states.
China selects astronauts to build own space station
BEIJING (Reuters) - A group of astronauts who will be involved in the construction of China's own space station has been selected as they receive training to prepare for the mission, according to the Chinese space authority. This was released by the Xinhua News Agency on Friday, March 5, 2021.
In 2021, China will launch a number of missions related to the construction of its space station, including the deployment of the station's core room, the delivery of supplies and the delivery of astronauts into space. Will be done in a row.
