(Svay Rieng): Mr. Nuon Ly Hourn, Director of Svay Rieng Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport, on behalf of Mr. Men Vibol, Provincial Governor, this morning, March 5, 2021, led the working group to organize the construction of a red gravel road. 1,050 meters long, 5 meters wide and installed light poles as a gift for the development project of the provincial administration.
Krong Pali opened the construction site for this road with the participation of Mr. Thong Samean, Deputy Chief of Bassac Commune Assistance Team, Mr. Hem Sarith, Svay Chrum District Governor, Deputy District Governor, District Land Office Chief, Commune Chief, Commune Council, Administrative Police Chief, Mr. Village chiefs, sub-villages, village members, residents and some road construction teams.
