Mr. Kim Sothin said that in order to take care of the ancestral heritage as well as the national heritage, the brick-and-mortar artisans can use their original location, but have to take the rubble from other places to avoid damaging or losing the label. Historical traces. He also asked for help to preserve some other archeological sites, such as the ancient lake temple, ancient hill for future generations.
