* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to the opposition group, which exaggerates the fact that the Chinese vaccinator is dead
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people not to go to Sihanoukville if it is not necessary and calls on the people of Sihanoukville not to cross the province for a while
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on Phnom Penh residents not to leave their homes unless absolutely necessary
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen agrees with the request of the Ministry of Education to close schools in Phnom Penh, Kandal and Sihanoukville for a while
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the preparation of the draft law on prevention of Kovid-19 and other infectious diseases is to punish those who violate the ban during the outbreak due to the previous sub-decree only fines
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen once again thanked the Australian Government for providing $ 28 million in assistance to Cambodia to purchase 19 Kovid vaccines.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterates that do not care about any country's vaccine, but care about how to buy vaccine because the world is in short supply
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the perpetrator of the violation of the Kovid 19 ban, if he came to me and did not drop his power, it would be valid
