The vaccination was presided over by Mr. Prak Sovann, Provincial Governor, and was attended by Dr. Kuong Lo, Advisor of the Ministry of Health and Director of the Preah Vihear Provincial Health Department, and Major General Sous Sok Dara, Preah Vihear Provincial Police Commissioner, and other government officials. Another picture.
