On behalf of the Preah Vihear Provincial Administration, Mr. Prak Sovann praised and appreciated the efforts of the provincial health officials, the three armed forces of the province, government officials and authorities at all levels, who have been paying close attention to the prevention. Outbreaks of Kovid-19 have been successful, with two Kovid-19 patients being cured and thousands of people being trained to prevent epilepsy.
At the same time, the Governor of Preah Vihear Province also expressed his apology from the people because the first vaccine was limited, so it was decided to give it to health officials, police officers, army and key leaders in advance and will be given to general civil servants and people. All step by step later.
