Secretary of State for Social Affairs and Secretary-General of the Disability Action Council, Mr. Em Chanmakara, commended the Australian Embassy for its direct support through the ACCESS program on disability in Cambodia. Mr. Em Chanmakara added that as the person in charge of the disability sector in Cambodia, he welcomes further recommendations to strengthen the disability sector better.
