Taking a good opportunity, he jumped up and hugged her from above. Suddenly, she woke up, grabbed his shirt and shouted for help, and a man, a master carpenter, who was sleeping in a nearby room, ran to help arrest him and handed him over to the military police. Chbar Ampov district at once. The suspect had been using drugs for more than a year.
