Police officers from the administrative post and the commune chief of Sontre confirmed that in the area of Phnom Kravanh district, there are wild pigs that often go from place to place looking for food such as cassava and other rootstocks. Can be eaten as food to feed their lives. Therefore, people must be very careful about possible accidents.
