The discovery and abduction of the four Vietnamese nationals took place on February 20, 2021, with the intervention of the Kambol Armed Forces in cooperation with the Kambol District Unity Command, Sangkat Boeung Thom Health Center. All 4 (1 female) who have just returned to Cambodia from Vietnam.
