The four Vietnamese left Cambodia for Vietnam on January 1, 2021, and arrived in Vietnam for 14 days. On his return to Cambodia, he arrived in Sangkat Boeung Thom, Khan Kambol, Phnom Penh, at 6:00 AM on February 20, 2021, sneaking through the corridor (Chrey Thom), Koh Thom District, Kandal Province, through Vietnamese and Cambodian smugglers by car. The price is $ 200, without a license plate.
