Ministry of National Defense Blesses Krong Pali to Lay Groundbreaking Ceremony
(Koh Kong): On the afternoon of February 22, 2021, the Ministry of National Defense and Administration of Koh Kong Province held a blessing ceremony for Krong Pali to lay the groundbreaking ceremony for the groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of the Veterans Tomb Field 447 war cadres who lost their lives during the war.
This afternoon, Krong Pali Blessing Ceremony was held in the presence of General Yon Min and General Bun Leut, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense, on behalf of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense. Provinces and commanders, deputy commanders of sub-regional operational areas, provincial military, provincial police commissioners, directors of all departments, provincial units are also members.
