The General Secretary of State emphasized that the cemetery for veterans should be built in the Khmer style. In addition to this, a team of experts studied and further improved the style of Angkor, and the history of this site placed the bodies of soldiers who sacrificed their lives for the integrity of the territory from July 1979 to 1998. Another 582 vehicles were inspected and fined on February 22, 2021
