In the morning of February 20, 2021, Ms. Keo Chankrisna, a resident of Meak 1 village, Prek Kak commune, Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province, told reporters on the disputed land that she had considered a friend named Chhon Mom lives in Sre Mean village, Preah Theat commune, Ou Raing Ov district, Kampong Cham province.
