Regarding the above allegations, Ms. Chhon Mom clarified by telephone that she did not betray her friend Keo Chankrisna, she was confused with me. She really bought the land together and only made a reservation to the landowner, when it came time to pay the down payment to the landowner, Keo Chankrisna, said he could not afford to pay the down payment, what can I do? .
