According to Mr. Chea Somethy, with the guidance of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Interior and His Excellency the Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group on Pearang District, as well as provincial and district committees and experts have studied all aspects. The project to rebuild Kampong Popil Market and communicate with the traders until the agreement to bury the foundation stone today.
