Comment: China stands with the world in the fight against Kovid 19
The rapid spread of Kovid 19 in China is a wake-up call for countries to be on high alert for the disease, and China is trying to share its relevant information and actions with the world. Possible.
But sadly, the accusers were not prepared to protect their people from the disease, but instead used the disease as a political tool to fulfill their dirty ambitions. Let there be a global epidemic faster than expected. In fact, we see China as the first person in the world to overcome Kovid-19 and the only economic entity with positive growth by 2020.
In this regard, Chinese President Xi Jinping has taken the initiative to consider vaccines as a public product, meaning that countries with the capacity to produce vaccines should distribute them to poor countries, developing countries and countries in line with the values of the Commonwealth of Humanity vision. .
In the face of global pandemics, the common enemy of all mankind, cooperation and solidarity are the strongest and most effective weapon for us to overcome this shadowless enemy. Many facts have shown that adherence to truth and virtue will gain the support and respect of the common people, regardless of race, color, language, or culture.
China, which adheres to the principles of honest, mutually beneficial and environmentally friendly diplomacy, has always actively contributed to the maintenance of world peace, stability, prosperity and progress, especially after the outbreak of the disease. Kovid-19 The whole world has seen firsthand that China has always stood with the world.
