(Phnom Penh): Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, Honorary President of the Cambodian People's Party and President of the National Assembly, urged party officials at all levels to be honest and serve the nation and the people wholeheartedly, determined to protect the party in all circumstances to prevent inactivity. Of party officials with strict adherence to the "mirroring, bathing, scrubbing, treatment and surgery" approach.
