Ministry of Education Issues Guidelines for Measures for Education Officers in National Units to Prevent and Prevent Kovid 19
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports on February 20, 2021 issued a guideline on measures for education officials working in national units to prevent and prevent 19 diseases.
The issuance of guidelines on measures for education officials working in the national unit follows the outbreak of the February 20 community event.
Please read the full instructions of the Ministry of Education below: The Ministry of Education tightens the implementation of health safety measures in public and private schools in Phnom Penh after the "February 20 community event"
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports on February 20, 2021 issued a notification on the strict implementation of safety measures for health in public and private schools in Phnom Penh after the "February 20 community event" eruption.
The Ministry of Education has stated that in order to prevent the spread of H5N1 virus in schools and spread in the community during the "February 20 community event", the Ministry requested public and private educational institutions to tighten the implementation of safety measures, health education and measures "3 prevention And 3 "from the date of this notice:
1. Strictly enforce the Standard Operating Procedures (SOP) for the re-establishment of educational institutions in the context of Code-19 of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, dated 04 August 2020.
2: Suspend gatherings and sports activities with more than 20 participants
3. The management of the educational institution must immediately report to the competent authority about the presence of contact with the affected person in the event of 20 February.
4: The management of the educational institution must summarize the report on the number of educational staff suspected to be related to the community event on 20 February
5. Affected educators must immediately report to the education authorities according to the hierarchy and apply the rules of ethics as accurately as possible. Kampot Provincial Governor Leads Officials and Relevant Authorities to Inspect the Construction of Roads and Sewerage System in Kampot City
