Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Special Message to Compatriots as Ministry Finds 32 Cases of Kovid Disease in Community on February 20
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the morning of February 20, 2021, delivered a special message to people all over the country regarding the new 19 cases of Kovid, which Samdech Techo called 20 cases of community infection. In February, the ministry found 32 cases across the community.
The following are the words of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who delivered a message to his compatriots for almost an hour:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that the Ministry of Health has detected up to 32 cases of community infection. Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers the discovery of the new Kovid 19 as a bad and serious event
In the case of Kovid 19 infection in the community on February 20, Samdech Techo Hun Sen issued an order and called on the Cambodian people to 6 points as follows:
First, Samdech requested the understanding of the business people and the residence of the people, which required the closure of the clubhouse and some areas where the 19 Kovid case erupted.
Second, continue to take the test sample for those in the area where there are 19 Kovid explosions, and after the test, be tested for 14 days, the number of tests may be large
Fourth, to be charitable for all those involved.
Fifth, Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on all those involved in the N8 Club and those related to the 32 patients with 19 Kovid to come and inspect the sample.
Sixth: Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the people in Phnom Penh and other areas to be more vigilant and restrict the implementation of three measures to prevent and 3 do not
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech did not issue an order to close weddings, schools or other places, but hoped that all people would continue to participate in the "3 protect 3 do not" measures
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges people to wear masks in all public places and keep gaps
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to tell people that if there is no need, please do not leave home
* Despite the outbreak of this community case, Samdech Techo Hun Sen did not cancel the program to attend the meeting of the Ministry of Interior and the inauguration of the Hai Yat Hotel
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on all provinces not to discriminate against the people living in Phnom Penh as the 19 Kovid eruptions in the community again
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for non-discrimination against Chinese people, even though this case of communism in the community happened to Chinese people in Cambodia
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen hopes that the community-wide cross-border event on February 20 will end within a month when all citizens and stakeholders cooperate and implement measures
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns Cambodian workers not to return from Thailand to participate in the Khmer New Year in April, because they will be stuck in the Chinese New Year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that as long as Kovid 19 is not finished, do not brag that you are strong, even though we have managed and prevented Kovid 19 well in the past
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ends his video message about the case in the community again at 10:34 this morning.
