One-star military officer driving carelessly hit one victim, dead and seriously injured, court charges
(Kampong Chhnang): A one-star military officer who drove a car that hit a child, killing a man and seriously injuring a man more than two months ago and suing the victim for more than $ 10,000 is now represented by the prosecutor Kampong Chhnang Province Accused of Reckless Driving, Hitting Others, Killing and Injuring Under Article 85 of the Road Traffic Law .
As for her husband, Vin Sola, 39 years old, he said that after the incident, he has been paralyzed in his left leg. Which makes life in the family very poor.
It should be noted that according to the conclusion of the report No. 70 dated 11 December 2020 of the Director of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Road Traffic Police Office, which was also signed by the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police Commissioner, it is clear that Mr. Kang Bunthoeun ( 1 star is the driver and owner of a black Toyota Land Cruiser with license plate Phnom Penh 2M-1186.
The military officer turned left and crossed the dirt road carelessly, without respecting the right of way, the straight road has the right to go first, does not respect the obligations of the Road Traffic Law, causing death and injury of others under Article 85 of the Traffic Law Road and ran from the scene in order to avoid civil liability to the victim with intent not to be criminally responsible by revealing the identity of the driver.
Therefore, according to the above report, the prosecutor has enough evidence to charge Mr. Bunthoeun, the accused who must be punished according to the law is not free. Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth Inaugurates Buildings and Infrastructure of Customs and Excise Office at Trapeang Phlong International Border Gate
