Mr. Uon Sovannara stated that from 2016 to the present, the achievements that will be officially inaugurated today include a new administrative building with a height of one and a half floors, measuring 23 meters by 20 meters, a two-story apartment building and One floor, a total of 31 rooms, car park, warehouse, water reservoir, canteen, pouring concrete, improving the garden and badminton court.
Beekeeping can earn an average of more than $ 10,000 per year
(Phnom Penh): A young man in Banteay Srei district, Siem Reap province can earn an average of more than 10,000 US dollars a year from beekeeping.
Mr. Ly Hour, a beekeeper in Khna Sanday commune, Banteay Srei district, Siem Reap province, confirmed that he had been beekeeping with his uncle in Ratanakkiri province for four years after gaining specific skills in beekeeping. He also returned to his hometown with more than 100 feeders for a start.
Speaking to Fresh News, Li Hua confirmed that raising bees is easier than raising animals and growing other crops. This beekeeping includes buckets of lobsters, beeswax and bees purchased from previous farmers, and for Banteay Srei this is a good location for beekeeping because in Banteay Srei there is a forest with flowers and many people grow flowers like cashew plantations. The rubber plantations also have a source of water that is easy for bees to pollinate.
He said that for natural bees and beekeepers there is a slight difference, but if he is, he gives the same price and quality if it has a clear source.
He added that the sale of more than 100 barrels of honey can be collected in large quantities only at the beginning of the year, only in January, and the return is more than $ 5,000 or more, depending on Real situation as well. In January, he can collect honey for wholesale, worth more than 40,000 riel per liter, or depending on negotiations.
On the other hand, in addition to collecting once in January, for the next month can collect about 30 liters or a little more.
He said that in the future, he wants to put more beekeeping containers, including more breeding grounds so that people in his area can have jobs and contribute to reducing poverty. Phnom Penh Capital Administration Continues to Use Electronic Garbage and Solid Waste Collection Rate for 2021
(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration on February 19, 2021 issued a notification on the implementation of garbage collection rate and solid waste in Phnom Penh for the transition period and the pre-payment mechanism for 2021. This is according to the announcement received by Fresh News on February 19, 2021.
According to the announcement, for 2021, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration will continue to use the rate of garbage collection and solid waste service in Phnom Penh, which is being implemented during this transition period, and will allow pre-payment (pre-payment) only. 6 months from January 2021 to June 2021.
For more information, please contact Phnom Penh Capital Hall or the official Facebook page of the Phnom Penh Municipal Authority for Waste and Solid Waste Management or by calling 087 258835.
