(Kampot): Mr. Chiao Tay, Governor of Kampot Province, on February 18, 2021, inaugurated the Damrey Phong Bridge in Kampong Chen Village, Stung Keo Commune, Teuk Chhou District, a precious gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprit. Dr. Bun Rany Hun Sen. The ceremony was also attended by monks and attended by about 500 people.
