The provincial governor also confirmed that the Damrey Phong Bridge is 41 meters long and 3 meters wide, built of wood with a budget of 65 million riels, can be used by pedestrians, motorbikes, trailers, tuk-tuks, cars from 12 seats down and load no more than 1,500 This bridge is an important infrastructure connecting Stung Keo commune, Teuk Chhou district to Chhouk district.
