(Stung Treng): The Cambodian National Council for Children has organized a workshop on promoting the implementation of the National Policy on Child Protection. This workshop will be held for 2 days from 18-19 February 2021 under the chairmanship of Mrs. Nheb Sopheap, Secretary General of the General Secretariat of the National Council of Cambodia for Children.
Speaking on that occasion, Ms. Kot Bunmey requested the members of the National Council of Cambodia for Children of Stung Treng Province to work hard to fulfill this work with a high sense of responsibility and good cooperation with relevant institutions in the protection of children who may be abused. Eventually, efforts will be made to take the knowledge in today's workshop for the benefit of child protection and the promotion of children's rights in Cambodia.
