* First, to promote the implementation of the National Policy on Child Protection System, which was approved by the Royal Government on May 29, 2020, to the sub-national level to participate in the promotion of children's rights and the best interests of children.
* Second: Identify strategic solutions and opportunities for cooperation between relevant institutions to promote the response and intervention of national policies on the child protection system. The organization of this workshop was supported by Plan International Cambodia.
