(Kandal): The representative of the Kandal Provincial Prosecutor, Mr. Hor Lina, charged the 12 people who committed violence in a land dispute in Khsach Kandal district, and the case was decided by the investigating judge of Kandal Provincial Court, Mr. Oeun Vanna. Release 12 people, but put them under the same judicial control so that they do not do the same thing again.
Mr. Tin Sochetra stated that in this case, the representative of the prosecution, Mr. Hor Lina, decided to charge all 12 of them and send the case to the investigating judge, and Mr. Oeun Vanna decided to release them, which consisted of 8 men and 4 women. To return home, but placed under the same judicial supervision to prevent them from committing this act again and again.
The 12 people were arrested and sent to court on February 16, 2021, after they violently violated a land dispute in Khsach Kandal district.
