(Kampong Cham): A meeting to review the work of 2020 and set the direction for 2021 of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, Kampong Cham Province was held this morning, February 18, 2021, in the presence of Mrs. Dam Darani, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense and Vice President of the Union. Youth Federation of Cambodia and Kampong Cham Provincial Governor Mr. Un Chanda.
