President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia in Kampong Cham, Mr. Han Kosal, said that youth begins with the opportunity to test their knowledge, skills and abilities, as well as creative ideas to create new experiences, expand Increase their creativity so that they can move forward with confidence and solve all the problems they face while they are traveling.
