In line with the spirit of the Cambodia Vision 2050 and the indications of the Rectangular Strategy Phase 4, the "Digital Economy and Social Policy Framework of Cambodia 2021-2035", which is considered to be comprehensive and highly realistic, will become a roadmap. An important path to digital revolution.
In addition, this policy framework has been developed in response to the global trends of the Industrial Revolution 4.0, as well as the digital revolution, which has been constantly evolving in the global and regional economies, especially in An environment that, since 2020, experiences and lessons from the Kovid-19 crisis have highlighted the growing potential of the digital revolution to drive development and economic growth.
This policy framework sets out the vision of "building a vibrant digital economy and society by laying the foundations for promoting digital adoption and evolution in all sectors of society, the state, the people and the business community in order to accelerate economic growth." New and improve social welfare in a new normal way ”focusing on five major priorities, including:
