(Kampong Speu): General Vong Pisen, Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, stated that the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces is the backbone of the nation and at all costs must firmly defend peace and resolutely oppose the color revolution, protect the people, protect The Royal Government legitimizes and protects the Constitution in order to mobilize all the potential for the development of the nation to be more prosperous.
